Provider marks in the web app
-----------------------------

Settings → Models shows a small vendor mark beside each provider name so a
row can be told apart at a glance. The artwork lives in app/assets/marks.js,
copied from Colonizer (https://github.com/Colonizer-dev/harness,
web/src/components/icons.tsx at commit 728680aa72a5cef5b88644f984f595a9ac166dab).
Most of the path data comes from the Simple Icons project
(https://simpleicons.org), whose SVG path data is released under the CC0 1.0
Universal public domain dedication
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

